WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:02.782
(groovy music)

00:00:03.879 --> 00:00:04.829
- Sit down.

00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:08.309
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:08.309 --> 00:00:09.210
- Wow, hi.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.500
- Have you ever met Ernie?

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.126
- I have not had the pleasure.
- No, we haven't.

00:00:12.126 --> 00:00:13.046
Yeah.
- Hi.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.005
- Oh.
- Pleasure's mine.

00:00:14.005 --> 00:00:15.424
- Well, look, look at this.

00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:17.490
You did it right now.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.500
- I'm just making sure I'm not...

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.340
- Oh, get it together.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.973
Yeah, no, we gotta keep all
our kibbles in business here.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.758
We wanna make sure they ask us back.

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:26.591
(audience laughing)

00:00:26.591 --> 00:00:27.424
- (chuckles) Yeah, that's the only reason

00:00:27.424 --> 00:00:28.410
I'm turning away from you.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.910
That's the only reason.
- No, it's fine, it's fine.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:30.743
I totally get it.

00:00:30.743 --> 00:00:32.100
- No, no, no, we understand it.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.890
But Ernie and I were talking
New Year's resolutions.

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:36.240
What you got, girl?

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.810
- Oh, I'm terrible with
New Year's resolutions.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:43.980
I try to make them and then
I never keep them, ever,

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:47.970
except for twice, the first
time I moved out to LA,

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:50.040
and this year's New Year's resolution,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.990
which is to move to New York.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:52.920
So I'm moving to New York.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.120
So these are the only two ones

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.830
that I've ever-
- Oh, wow.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:56.663
- Yeah.

00:00:56.663 --> 00:00:58.350
- So you got a little
traveling spirit on you.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.409
I like it.
- Yeah, just a little.

00:00:59.409 --> 00:01:00.570
- I like it.
- Yeah.

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:03.000
- So when you shoot the
show, "Emily in Paris",

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.300
are you guys actually
filming there in Paris?

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.788
- Yeah, in Paris.

00:01:07.788 --> 00:01:09.217
- Talk about it.
- It's incredible.

00:01:09.217 --> 00:01:11.093
- Talk about it.
- Yeah, I know. I hadn't...

00:01:11.093 --> 00:01:13.770
I'd been once with, like, a
school trip, when I was 16,

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:15.603
and I don't remember anything.

00:01:16.558 --> 00:01:19.410
And then, now, all summer
long, we were shooting.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.900
So I would fly back and
forth for a few days,

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.850
and I'd have all this time off,

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.422
and I'd, "Look, the Eiffel
Tower selfie," you know?

00:01:27.422 --> 00:01:28.860
(everyone laughing)

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:29.693
And it was so cool.

00:01:29.693 --> 00:01:31.411
It was awesome, yeah.

00:01:31.411 --> 00:01:32.670
- One of your first big roles

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:35.659
was in "Guardians of the Galaxy".

00:01:35.659 --> 00:01:36.913
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:01:36.913 --> 00:01:38.729
Yeah.

00:01:38.729 --> 00:01:41.262
- It's a crowd-pleaser,
that one, yeah. (chuckles)

00:01:41.262 --> 00:01:44.370
- Do you get recognized for that role?

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:48.960
- Mercifully not, because
I was bright pink,

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.210
head to toe, with yellow eyes.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:55.297
So hopefully people don't
look at me and be like,

00:01:55.297 --> 00:01:57.283
"Oh yeah, that's that alien."

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:58.116
(audience laughing)

00:01:58.116 --> 00:01:58.949
- Well-

00:01:58.949 --> 00:02:03.030
- But yeah, there was one time
at the airport I was a mess.

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:04.680
I was going to Mexico with my mom,

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.680
and I had the biggest zit in
the middle of my forehead.

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:09.123
It was like a unicorn, like...

00:02:09.123 --> 00:02:09.956
(audience laughing)

00:02:09.956 --> 00:02:12.540
And that was the time that
somebody was right in front

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:13.920
and they kept stealing glances.

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.110
And I kept doing this.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.697
And I think they think
that I was being like,

00:02:18.697 --> 00:02:21.127
"Don't look at me," but
what I was doing is,

00:02:21.127 --> 00:02:23.510
"Oh God, this is such a big
zit," you know? (laughs)

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.343
(audience laughing)

00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:25.620
They must be looking at the zit.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.847
So they eventually were like,

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.130
"Were you in 'Guardians of the...'"

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.470
I was like, "Oh, yes, yes."

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.180
So I think "Ah, you're
not looking at my zit."

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.350
- "I thought you were looking
at this big thing right here.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:35.520
No, yes, 'Guardians'.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:37.369
That was me."
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:37.369 --> 00:02:38.257
"Guardians."

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:39.090
(audience applauds)

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:39.923
(laughs). Yeah.

00:02:39.923 --> 00:02:43.500
And your character is so
iconic on "Ghostbusters".

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.333
Do you get...

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:48.330
Do people send you photos
dressed like the character?

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:51.150
- Yeah, no, I get photos,
people with tattoos.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.200
I went to buy a car,

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:56.640
and the mechanic there
had my face tattooed

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:57.990
on his leg.
- (gasps) Wow.

00:02:59.446 --> 00:03:03.295
- And I was complimented by that, I think.

00:03:03.295 --> 00:03:04.590
(everyone laughs)

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:07.710
You know, but yeah, no,
"Ghostbusters" is quite a phenomenon

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.930
all over the world,
and I'm so, so thankful

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.150
to be a part of that, as
"Guardians", I'm sure.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:12.983
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:03:12.983 --> 00:03:13.816
- Yeah, it's really fun.

00:03:13.816 --> 00:03:15.180
- Well, I think I mostly
get people dressing up

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.517
like the cast of "Reno 911".

00:03:18.385 --> 00:03:19.595
- Yeah (laughs).

00:03:19.595 --> 00:03:21.510
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.790
Thank God I wasn't the
one in the booty shorts,

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:25.590
'cause that would've been a problem.

